    "evidence": "Primary-first own source/API contract and complete current production proof prereview frozen BEFORE independent blind reconstruction. Fresh PBPSv1 Section2.2 HTML168-212/AppendixC.1 HTML1197-1229 and SPHMCv1 Section4.1 HTML403-430 independently reread2026-10-06. All247/32/74 production lines,5private helpers,112-line Test and6+3+3+4 authored reader steps/source/assumption/provenance/bindings independently checked, matching immutable proof freeze explicitly reused. All seven slots compared to current independent source-blind reconstruction. No substantive scoped delta found. Exact8admin diffs verified androotbefore snapshots matchownprimary-first raw; all36 nonadmin inputs unchanged. Currentpublicationbindings/context remain identical to independently recomputed prereview. Sourceauthored prerequisites distinguished from numbered source results; fullactualconstantiff credit bounded tothese statements, no Poincare/BL/epsilon0/range/core/main. No compilation/math-verdict used as source evidence.",
